      "text": "Design chat application",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design chat application",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "5Q2hyJNGGDdzp6TWjkce4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 273.5,
      "y": 189.75,
      "width": 884.9999999999999,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0K",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1605908597,
      "version": 52,
      "versionNonce": 1649165525,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792056984888,
      "created": 1791801889586,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1M DAU × 20 msgs/day = 20M msgs/day ≈ 200/s avg, ~1K peak; ~100K concurrent\nWebSocket connections (≈ 10-50K per server → a few servers); ~2 GB/day ≈ 700 GB/yr",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1M DAU × 20 msgs/day = 20M msgs/day ≈ 200/s avg, ~1K peak; ~100K concurrent WebSocket connections (≈ 10-50K per server → a few servers); ~2 GB/day ≈ 700 GB/yr",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "7WO8UqnBYv7C3rwaxR_bJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 278.5,
      "y": 299.9166650772095,
      "width": 738.9197387695312,
      "height": 1450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0L",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 325070229,
      "version": 1896,
      "versionNonce": 1566451477,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792056719164,
      "created": 1791801939519,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional requirement\n\n1. user should be able to create the chat 1:1 and group\n2. user can send/receive the msg in realtime ~200ms\n3. user can see chat history + current chats\n4. (Optional) user ccan share files\n5. user should be able to signin/signup\n6. user can see total chats linked to their account\n7. notification if user is offline\n\nNon functional requirement\n\n- System must handle 20M msg/day \n- secure login through jwt\n- low latency ~200ms \n- availability >> consistency (a user can tolerate few sec of delay)\n\nBack of envelope estimations\n- scale 1M DAU & 20msg/day\n- rps 10^6 * 20 = 2*10^7/10^5 = 2*10^2 = 200rps | peak 200*3 = 600 rps\n- throughput 1KB * 600 = 600KB \n- storage (20*10^6 )*10^3=20*10^9 = 20GB/day   20*365 = ~8TB/year\n- bandwidth 600*8 = ~5Mbps\n- concurrent connections 10%1M = 100k\n\ncore entities\n- users\n- messages\n- groups/chats\n- notifications\n\nAPI design\n// signup\nPOST /api/users/signup \n{\n    username,\n    password,\n    userDetails..\n} -> 201 | jwt token\n\n// signin\nGET /api/users/signin?username={}&password={}\n-> 200 | jwt token\n\n// Create chat (user or group)\nPOST /api/chats/new\n{\n    receiver_id? ,\n    name,\n    contact,\n    email,\n    profileImg\n} -> 202 \n\n// Load all chats of user\nGET /api/chats/{userId} -> 200 | 404 List<Chats>\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional requirement\n\n1. user should be able to create the chat 1:1 and group\n2. user can send/receive the msg in realtime ~200ms\n3. user can see chat history + current chats\n4. (Optional) user ccan share files\n5. user should be able to signin/signup\n6. user can see total chats linked to their account\n7. notification if user is offline\n\nNon functional requirement\n\n- System must handle 20M msg/day \n- secure login through jwt\n- low latency ~200ms \n- availability >> consistency (a user can tolerate few sec of delay)\n\nBack of envelope estimations\n- scale 1M DAU & 20msg/day\n- rps 10^6 * 20 = 2*10^7/10^5 = 2*10^2 = 200rps | peak 200*3 = 600 rps\n- throughput 1KB * 600 = 600KB \n- storage (20*10^6 )*10^3=20*10^9 = 20GB/day   20*365 = ~8TB/year\n- bandwidth 600*8 = ~5Mbps\n- concurrent connections 10%1M = 100k\n\ncore entities\n- users\n- messages\n- groups/chats\n- notifications\n\nAPI design\n// signup\nPOST /api/users/signup \n{\n    username,\n    password,\n    userDetails..\n} -> 201 | jwt token\n\n// signin\nGET /api/users/signin?username={}&password={}\n-> 200 | jwt token\n\n// Create chat (user or group)\nPOST /api/chats/new\n{\n    receiver_id? ,\n    name,\n    contact,\n    email,\n    profileImg\n} -> 202 \n\n// Load all chats of user\nGET /api/chats/{userId} -> 200 | 404 List<Chats>\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
