      "text": "we will use redis stream for decoupled andd async \nnotification processing cutting 200ms per msg processing \ncost\nthe server will add event into the stream only if the \nconnection is unavailable in redis cache ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "we will use redis stream for decoupled andd async \nnotification processing cutting 200ms per msg processing \ncost\nthe server will add event into the stream only if the \nconnection is unavailable in redis cache ",
